a/screenshots/9d1/9d12fe709e4bc87166b1cdb2101fa91b.jpg"}, {"id": 110, "name": "Cinematic", "slug": "cinematic", "language": "eng", "games_count": 3437, "image_background": "https://media.rawg.io/media/games/c50/c5085506fe4b5e20fc7aa5ace842c20b.jpg"}, {"id": 188, "name": "Parkour", "slug": "parkour", "language": "eng", "games_count": 4125, "image_background": "https://media.rawg.io/media/games/849/849414b978db37d4563ff9e4b0d3a787.jpg"}, {"id": 305, "name": "Linear", "slug": "linear", "language": "eng", "games_count": 9945, "image_background": "https://media.rawg.io/media/games/5bf/5bf88a28de96321c86561a65ee48e6c2.jpg"}, {"id": 166, "name": "Stylized", "slug": "stylized", "language": "eng", "games_count": 10507, "image_background": "https://media.rawg.io/media/games/b6b/b6b20bfc4b34e312dbc8aac53c95a348.jpg"}, {"id": 229, "name": "3D Platformer", "slug": "3d-platformer", "language": "eng", "games_count": 12299, "image_background": "https://media.rawg.io/media/games/cfc/cfc91eccc1de338b75a0576310ccbcec.jpg"}, {"id": 91686, "name": "Family Sharing", "slug": "family-sharing", "language": "eng", "games_count": 30523, "image_background": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/68b/68bcfe02c9b9b7123edab7ecce3f2660.jpg"}, {"id": 112, "name": "Minimalist", "slug": "minimalist", "language": "eng", "games_count": 17582, "image_background": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/8f6/8f608c5aae578bc1e4810921fd9fcd69.jpg"}, {"id": 220, "name": "Experimental", "slug": "experimental", "language": "eng", "games_count": 9739, "image_background": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/76a/76a4511b693e10e282463b5904a2f450.jpg"}], "publishers": [{"id": 79094, "name": "Rubeki Games", "slug": "rubeki-games", "games_count": 2, "image_background": "https://media.rawg.io/media/games/ac1/ac1b4658e64e19f27ca0fd4d68df68f8.jpg"}, {"id": 38868, "name": "Rubeki", "slug": "rubeki", "games_count": 3, "image_background": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/624/624d0b8b04475d4613dcc3da87a27099.jpg"}], "esrb_rating": null, "clip": null, "description_raw": "Lorn's Lure is an atmospheric narrative first-person platformer with novel climbing mechanics and modernized retro 3D graphics.\n\nLeaving his home colony while tracking a mysterious glitch, an android finds himself in the midst of a vast and dangerous structure, completely hidden from his people's knowledge. Unable to go back, you must keep going to find out where he is being led... And why he left in the first place.\n\n\n\nDark foreboding atmosphere\nRetro 90s PC graphics, with a modern flair.\nUncover mysterious lore as you travel into the depths.\nJump, climb, slide, and scan your way around difficult challenges, using simple mechanics.\nNo \"Parkour Ledges\". Climb almost any vertical wall face using your pickaxes!\nIt's a tough game, but not frustrating! Mistakes are not punished by redoing lengthy sections.\nPlay fast or slow. Take in the sights as you traverse, or play as fast as a speed runner."}